/license></permissions><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d32e64" vol="49" page="217" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18452257" ext-link-type="pubmed"><article-title>The Effect of Lowering the Threshold for Diagnosis of Impaired Fasting Glucose</article-title></related-article></article-meta></front><body><p>In Yonsei Med J 2008 April;49(2):217-223,</p><p><underline>The Effect of Lowering the Threshold for Diagnosis of Impaired Fasting Glucose</underline></p><p><underline>So Hun Kim, Wan Sub Shim, Eun A Kim, Eun Joo Kim, Seung Hee Lee, Seong Bin Hong, Yong Seong Kim, Shin Goo Park, Jong Whan Lim, Hun-Jae Lee, and Moonsuk Nam</underline></p><p>the name of the 9<sup>th</sup> author was misspelled, and should be corrected as follows:</p><p>The Effect of Lowering the Threshold for Diagnosis of Impaired Fasting Glucose</p><p>So Hun Kim, Wan Sub Shim, Eun A Kim, Eun Joo Kim, Seung Hee Lee, Seong Bin Hong, Yong Seong Kim, Shin Goo Park, <underline><bold>Jong Han Leem</bold></underline>, Hun-Jae Lee, and Moonsuk Nam</p></body></article>